                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJ3eVGaACtQjQRgQvpyfaX5Fs/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT205V01pMDRkR0ZuYUVwNFEzTmxMVFZOZG5CWFRuYxAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "10 months ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "This Hawaiian-style restaurant has quickly become one of my go-to spots. The food is not only delicious but also incredibly authentic — you can really taste the island vibes in every bite. I usually order the combo for two, and it never disappoints. From the fresh salad to the flavorful main courses and the satisfying desserts, everything is consistently excellent.\n\nThe desserts are definitely worth saving room for — sweet, tropical, and the perfect way to end the meal.\n\nWhat really sets this place apart, though, is the atmosphere. The playful, colorful decor instantly puts you in a good mood and truly makes you feel like you’re dining in Hawaii. It’s a fun and relaxing spot that brings a little vacation energy to every visit.\n\nHighly recommend if you’re craving something tropical and tasty!",
                                     "languageCode":  "en"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
